RESULT: Task confirmed gone via a genuine "not found" error, not just the unregister command's
exit code. Combined with the same-day Administrator password rotation
(evidence/administrator-password-rotated-no-disclosure.json), the credential this task held is
now doubly closed — the stored value is gone, and even if it had leaked, that password no
longer authenticates.
